WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.920
Hey, it's Pinky!

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.140
If you've been finding the percent,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
then subtracting, then doing it all over again,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.660
I have good news.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.020
One move does all of it.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.160
A percent change is just a multiplication:

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.080
the starting value,

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.080
times one plus or minus the rate.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.760
Twenty percent off means you keep eighty percent.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.840
So you multiply by point eight.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.460
Twenty percent up?

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.260
Multiply by one point two.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.280
A fifty dollar hoodie,

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.460
twenty percent off.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.240
Don't find the twenty percent and then subtract.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.640
You keep eighty percent.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.200
Fifty times point eight.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.660
Forty dollars.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.600
Your turn. Eighty dollars,

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.600
twenty-five percent off.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:48.960
What do you multiply by,

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.240
and what's the price?

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.140
Go.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.700
Point seven five!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.780
Eighty times that is sixty dollars.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.480
Here's why this is so good.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.260
Two changes in a row?

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.980
Just multiply the factors.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:12.700
Up twenty percent,

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.200
then down twenty percent.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.220
One point two,

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.460
times point eight.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.140
Point nine six.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.400
And look at that.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.360
Up twenty, down twenty,

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.080
and you do not get back to the start.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.460
They don't cancel,

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:29.480
because the second twenty percent is twenty percent of a

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.380
bigger number.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.560
Last trap. Always name the base.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.540
Going from forty to fifty is a change of ten.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.200
Ten out of forty,

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.340
the starting value,

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.720
is twenty-five percent.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:42.920
Not twenty.

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.300
A percent change is a multiplication.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.060
And always ask:

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.260
percent of what?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.220
Now hit Try this skill,

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:52.120
and go get 'em!
